        "name": "USN-9006-1",
        "description": "It was discovered that Pod::Text in Perl did not properly handle POD documents with deeply nested =over directives. If a user or automated system were tricked into processing a specially crafted file, an attacker could possibly use this issue to cause CPU and memory exhaustion, resulting in a denial of service.",
